.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-DOWN 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-down
.Nd stop the container stack
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad down
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm nomad down
stops the Project NOMAD container stack
.Pq Ic docker compose down .
Run it before unplugging the external data drive so the databases and model
store are flushed and closed cleanly. Bring the stack back with
.Xr nomad-up 1 .
.Pp
It takes no arguments.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad down
Stop the stack; safe to do before disconnecting the data drive.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-up 1 ,
.Xr nomad-restart 1
